Z||000009||Master_Sushi||11-17-2001||12:36 AM||||I have never jumped my fiero before. I don't plan on doing it any time soon either <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">. I have done just about everything else destructive/damaging in a fiero though.<P>I jumped my saab9000 turbo once. I was doing about 135mph(top speed, about 4.8k rpm in 5th gear  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) and hit a dip in the road, front wheels probably came an inch or two off the road. Those speeds are scary, let alone in the air and having no steering control! <BR>Won't be doing that again any time soon.....<P>||||reg||10
